@label "Katakana"
@description "The 46 basic katakana in table order, each with its Hepburn reading: ア a, カ ka, シ shi, チ chi, ツ tsu, フ fu, ヲ wo, ン n. Each sounds like the hiragana at the same place."
@tags "kana" "japanese" "alphabet" "data"
